\section{Conclusion}
This chapter presents the global architecture of UKG-SE v2.0, integrating ADM, York, 
CTS, non-commutative algebra, and residual correction into a single coherent system. 
The architecture ensures constraint preservation, geometric consistency, and numerical 
stability across dynamically evolving spacetimes, including high-spin Kerr geometries.